      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "Hi Everyone,\nI am holding a Ladies Pamper Evening at Orsett Village Hall, Essex on the 11th July to raise funds for the South Essex Branch of The Motor Neurone Disease Association!\nThey have supported my Dad and us over the years and I want to give something back!\nI am looking for other WAHMs to have tables, so far I have Virgin Vie, Tish Tash Toys, Usbourn, Avon and one jewellery lady! I am also looking for people who can offer treatments!\nIf you would like further info please contact me at renee.venus@yahoo.co.uk\nThanks\nRenee\n😀",
